WHEN SEGEMENTATION FAULT. anthro_emis: Note that using this script for an area covering the North pole(s),
can result in a segmentation fault
Then some modifications have to be made in the subroutine area_interp in area_mapper.f90
See this subroutine for the instructions (MAQ_lg_20190425* comments) on how to detect the source and fix the problem
  
